{
  "epId": 6996,
  "name": "悬木人",
  "desc": "<p>纳塔的六部族之一，也称为维茨特兰。该部族的人热爱极限运动如攀岩、高空索降、火山跑酷等等，并与匿叶龙共同生活。</p>",
  "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/01/326985891/79ebff2a0e10528e9129a10ee3043668_3300134419887747529.png",
  "menuId": 23,
  "menuName": "组织",
  "version": 1762098568,
  "components": {
    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "过场动画与预告",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》定格动画——纳塔部族印象"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/08/31/237301566/60094afc2111c06296aee0d8612ef2fd_6097913331375178884.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2024年8月17日</color>\n「圣火竞技场」的勇士们即将展开角逐，在等待开场的这段时间里，不妨先听三位朋友讲讲他们部族的生活百味…\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=YthNxvse7xc"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》卡齐娜的笔记-「纳塔的龙伙伴们」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/01/326985891/534496d5f655e526a163e7257a5a597a_2499723833414790572.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2024年8月28日</color>\n在探索纳塔的旅程中，少不了与各个部族的龙打交道。与龙同行，欣赏纳塔更多的风景吧。\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=cCKPbNPTRPg"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "展示页",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "「悬木人」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/02/326985891/cd12e9ef0b68aa535eb88efc4545e59e_7497570561029793964.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2024年8月19日</color>\n旅行者好呀！\n听说某个部族的人们非常喜欢冒险，甚至有时会做出常人眼里十分危险的事。一起来了解他们吧！"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "著名成员"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "尤潘基\n从灰烬城的暴君，",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7296,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "手中偷走了回火的英雄。他的古名是\n。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7496,
        "name": "布基纳",
        "desc": "<p>纳塔的六英杰之一，继承古名「<custom-ruby data-ruby=\"马|回|力|火|卜\"></custom-ruby>」。他于五百年前灾变期间死于他的伙伴之手。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/10/26/326985891/72c2727153942e702ee7bc8dd32597b7_1491745743439913360.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "于500年前",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7089,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 20
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "中去世的部族英雄。他的伙伴是",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6583,
        "name": "贪食匿叶龙山王",
        "desc": "自古老的年代存活至今，经历了无数战场的强大匿叶龙。<br>曾经与众英杰们携手面对漆黑潮水的「山王」，在「悬木人」部族的成员心中具备极重的分量。有部族人认为，它有着现在这样的体态，是与绒翼龙的「暴君」一般，拥有着特殊的体质…但也许只是因为它活得太长，而吃得也实在太多了的缘故。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/08/27/7c1ed7d240424237bc75660e96f3f0ee_7099496042074492058.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 7
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "。布基纳的古名是\n。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7299,
        "name": "玛薇卡",
        "desc": "纳塔的领袖，继承「基扬戈兹」之古名，誓以圣火为战争国度照亮未来。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/12/30/2f098b1f15854fd9dafc54998795a59e_864981592196815761.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "拥有古名\n的现任火神。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7015,
        "name": "瓦伊纳",
        "desc": "<p>悬木人的首领。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/02/326985891/4a4a69936b5b8c85250d8a31b63276c7_5988325161700292052.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "部落首领",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6317,
        "name": "基尼奇",
        "desc": "维茨特兰的猎龙人，精于度量代价。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/09/12/0099e74b4d0c919f6feab4bade3ab748_5795733017114624391.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "猎龙人。他是悬木人的英雄，其古名\n也被认可。\n维查玛\n传奇的战士与部族的侦查师。 他于深渊的侵袭中阵亡。\n穆尔科\n部族的战士，也是维查玛的好友。他在「巡夜者战争」中牺牲。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "地区"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7091,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 20
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "人物关系"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6582,
        "name": "匿叶龙",
        "desc": "拥有强壮的后肢与蓬松的尾部，能够吐出藏在颊袋中的火榴果胶卷住远处物体的龙。<br>传说中，原本的匿叶龙并非现在的模样，而是更小，小到不易被观察到的程度。它们甚至可以随意游荡在风中，依附在其他巨龙的身体表面，或是如云一般群聚与游移。只是后来为了能够维持住能力退化后的形态，不得不选择现在的身姿。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/08/27/e1b8a6914176a0a3a9f003da76eff025_8330021945359045493.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 7
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6581,
        "name": "幼匿叶龙",
        "desc": "年幼的匿叶龙，可以吐出藏在颊袋中的火榴果胶卷住远处的物体。<br>卷住物体的力量并不强，自身的平衡感也远未达到可在空中自如穿梭的程度，有时即使是坐在尾巴上也会不由自主地向着一侧倾倒。不过终有一日，能够成长为在林间悠然摆荡的样貌吧。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/08/27/4dc2c6255f04404b37be8b6e7619433e_997530024683997417.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 7
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "部落的伙伴",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "相关书籍与物品"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6545,
        "name": "山王长牙",
        "desc": "由纯然的绿松石锻造而成的巨剑，因其远超一般兵刃的重量而被冠以「山王」康加玛托之名。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/08/23/1fd3c498faccab68bfa5d961477a8c29_2936359463997877474.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 4
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6548,
        "name": "撼地者",
        "desc": "人称「窃火者」的英杰爱用的重剑，据说就连烬城之王的烈火也未能将其焚断。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/08/23/dc6bf4c87afe67014579743618e97371_6360663376854922140.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 4
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7030,
        "name": "硕果钩",
        "desc": "为了一度夺得品质冠绝纳塔的火榴果，悬木人的勇士布基纳在英雄特诺切的帮助下特意打制的武器。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/09/27/25c75653d47f882870e96d9119a17e9a_6960324287026452673.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 4
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4000,
        "name": "聊聊棒",
        "desc": "<p>一柄沉重的镶有黑曜石的大棒，有很强的说服力。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/08/16/47826599/b1773be7f0c6b80e5ca8fd4a71dbd78a_4340935892717683526.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 4
      },
