        "name": "烬城勇者绘卷",
        "desc": "",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/08/23/6ad5095f324c2da829ecaa5e2ed13af9_2791497672459683103.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 5
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6854,
        "name": "翠青曜石环",
        "desc": "刻画有「悬木人」风格纹饰的黑曜石环，是部族与深沉夜晚建立联系所用的古老媒介，或许可以凭借它的力量跨越某处的边界…",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/08/23/48ada37ecd3e564867234017ed6ad31c_2209015726031891165.png",
